                <pb facs="0434" n="388" xml:id="pg388"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.00/2783e</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to President Wilson </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-09-27">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 27, 1918</hi>
                        </date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. President</hi>: The Italian Ambassador
                    told me today that his Government telegraphed him that they would send no High
                    Commissioner to Siberia though urged to do so by the British and French
                    Governments, and that they desired to conform their policy to ours in such
                    matters.</p>
                <p>Faithfully yours,</p>
                <closer>[File copy not signed]</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
